body><tr><td class="mbox-image"><div class="mbox-image-div"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img resource="./File:Text_document_with_red_question_mark.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Text_document_with_red_question_mark.svg/40px-Text_document_with_red_question_mark.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Text_document_with_red_question_mark.svg/120px-Text_document_with_red_question_mark.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="" data-file-width="48" data-file-height="48" data-file-type="drawing" height="40" width="40" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span></div></td><td class="mbox-text"><div class="mbox-text-span">This article includes a list of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Wikipedia:Citing_sources#General_references" title="Wikipedia:Citing sources">general references</a> <b>but lacks sufficient corresponding <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Wikipedia:Citing_sources#Inline_citations" title="Wikipedia:Citing sources">inline citations</a></b>.<span class="hide-when-compact"> Please help <a rel="mw:ExtLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Wegman_Report&amp;action=edit" class="external text" data-mw-original-href="//en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Wegman_Report&amp;action=edit">improve this article</a> by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Wikipedia:When_to_cite" title="Wikipedia:When to cite">introducing</a> more precise citations.</span>  <span class="date-container"><i>(<span class="date">November 2026</span>)</i></span><span class="hide-when-compact"><i> (<small><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Help:Maintenance_template_removal" title="Help:Maintenance template removal">Learn how and when to remove this message</a></small>)</i></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table><span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt1"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href=